 "_doc": "Ray Nkonyeni Local Municipality (Port Shepstone) Emunsoft 'TAX INVOICE/STATEMENT OF ACCOUNT': masthead with the municipality's own VAT No. 4400275071, Account Number / Account Date / Tax Invoice No / ERF / Street / Deposit block, a METER READINGS table in two print variants (older: OLD | NEW | flag | CONSUMPTION | LEVIED AMOUNT | 'dd/mm/yyyy - dd/mm/yyyy'; newer: OLD | NEW | READING DATE | READING TYPE A/E/I | CONSUMPTION), an ACCOUNT DETAILS ledger ('date code DESCRIPTION units @ tariff * value', credits with trailing '-'), a VAT line and an aging strip ending CLOSING BALANCE / TOTAL DUE THIS MONTH. Values are ex VAT. Electricity lines = 'ELECTRICITY <amps>' (energy, single flat band -> standard) and '<type> (<amps>) BASIC CHARGE' (-> other_r); total_ex_vat_r = their sum. total_kwh / readings / meter / reading type come from the meter table (the ledger units equal the table consumption on 12/12). read_start only exists on the older variant. Fingerprint: VAT 4400275071 + 'RAY NKONYENI'. IDENTITY ray_ident_ex = closing balance - opening balance - every non-electricity ledger line (payments, VAT, interest): 0.00 on 12/12; VAT line = 15% of total_ex on 12/12. Checked on 12 bills.",
